#showas:屈膝
Bend the Knee (Royal 9)
Difficulty: Challenging (advanced tactics)


The Royal AI seeks dominion of this encapsulated galaxy, but 3 independent Dyson Spheres resist total subjugation.

An allegiance with the Dyson could be fruitful, but beware if the AI comes to the same conclusion.

An initial survey of the galaxy reveals that the galaxy is scarce in derelict fleets, but the many advanced research stations can help boost the line-up of your fleets. 

There may be powerful flagships in the fringes of the galaxy ... scouting will be crucial for making long-term plans.

A word of caution: Royal Guardians are fearsome foes that should be approached cautiously if without overwhelming force.